{"encoding":"verislop.autonomous-critique/0.1","verdict":"REPAIR","counterexamples":[],"corrections":[{"diagnostic_index":0,"artifact":"proposal.lean","explanation":"Replace the unresolved proof of VeriSlopAST.source_contract with `by exact VeriSlop.Source.contract_sound VeriSlopAST.SolveSource`. Replace VeriSlopAST.assumption_inhabited's unsuccessful guessed witnesses with `by refine ⟨VeriSlopAST.Input.mk [] 0 0 1 \"none\", ?_⟩; simp [VeriSlopAST.valid_input]`. For VeriSlopAST.aggregation_contract, split the outer value/source conjunction; discharge its source component with VeriSlop.Source.contract_sound VeriSlopAST.SolveSource. Split the value component into universal refinement and the two public examples. Prove universal refinement by introducing the input and precondition and unfolding solve, groups, group_rows, buckets and stats, then using rfl. Prove the closed example equations with `cbv <;> simp_all <;> done`. Preserve all frozen statements, definitions, instances, imports and registry; remove the corresponding sorry fallbacks only after these proof terms check."}]}